# Server-side only. The OpenAI generator and the optional LLM judge read this
# from the process environment. The package does not load secret files.
#
# The public site reads the same name inside the Next.js server. When it is
# unset, /api/query uses a hashing index, BM25, and quotes the top passage.
# When it is set, embeddings and the written answer use OpenAI. Do not prefix
# it with NEXT_PUBLIC_. The web app does not load a secrets file either.
OPENAI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Absolute URL used for Open Graph metadata. Defaults to the
# production Vercel domain when unset.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://advanced-rag-evaluation.vercel.app
